        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of Hürtgen Forest, Battle of Pusan Perimeter\n- Organizations: American forces, German forces, United Nations forces, North Korean forces\n- Places: Hürtgen Forest, Western Front, Belgian–German border\n- Topics: World War II, Korean War\n\nFacts:\n- The Battle of Hürtgen Forest was a series of fierce battles fought from 19 September to 16 December 1944 between American forces and German forces on the Western Front during World War II in the Hürtgen Forest about 50 square miles east of the Belgian–German border.\n- The Battle of Pusan Perimeter was a large-scale battle between United Nations forces and North Korean forces lasting from 4 August to 18 September 1950.",
